name: Oops! All 6s — probability doubler
author: corpus
description: >-
  Oops! All 6s doubles all listed probabilities (1 in 4 becomes 2 in 4, i.e. guaranteed).
  First-shop odds engine: Hallucination (1/2 → 1/1), Bloodstone (1/2 → 1/1), Space Joker
  (1/4 → 1/2), 8 Ball (1/4 → 1/2), Lucky cards.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Hallucination
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: SpaceJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Bloodstone
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: EightBall
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 35
    label: "Showman (2nd Oops = x4 luck)"
